WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:33.416
In this thirty-fifth verse, the concluding
verse of Chapter 13,

2
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:37.458
Lord Krishna presents the essence
of this entire chapter –

3
00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:40.416
‘Kshetra-Kshetrajna-Vibhaga Yoga.’

4
00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:42.791
He explains that true knowledge

5
00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:46.000
comes from the clear understanding
of three things –

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.083
The first – the distinction between the body,
which is called the kshetra,

7
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:54.166
and the kshetrajna who knows it.

8
00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:57.958
The second point – the difference between
the jiva,

9
00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:02.041
the individual soul, and the Paramatma.

10
00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:05.250
The third point – liberation,

11
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.000
that is the process of moksha,

12
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.083
by which the soul rises above material bondage

13
00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:13.708
and attains the supreme goal.

14
00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:20.333
Lord Krishna says –

15
00:01:20.333 --> 00:01:24.000
the temporary body is made, including
the mind and the senses,

16
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.416
of the twenty-four material elements,

17
00:01:26.416 --> 00:01:29.916
while the nature of the soul is entirely different –

18
00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:33.000
eternal and unchanging.

19
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.541
According to Him,

20
00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:35.750
the vision of the

21
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.958
wise one who sees

22
00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:38.833
these facts from the perspective

23
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.708
of knowledge is the truest of all.

24
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.750
He clarifies that the body

25
00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.666
is made of gross and subtle matter,

26
00:01:45.666 --> 00:01:48.083
which arises from Prakriti.

27
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:50.791
The soul only resides within it

28
00:01:50.791 --> 00:01:53.291
and provides it consciousness –

29
00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:54.958
just as the sun illuminates

30
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:57.125
the entire universe.

31
00:01:57.125 --> 00:02:02.000
This was explained in verse 13.34.

32
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.000
One who understands this distinction

33
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:04.875
does not connect

34
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:06.666
their identity with the body

35
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:09.958
and becomes free from material bondages.

36
00:02:09.958 --> 00:02:11.291
Although both the jiva

37
00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:14.166
and the Paramatma reside in the body,

38
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:17.208
their roles are different.

39
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:18.958
The jiva, due to ignorance,

40
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:21.125
becomes one with the body

41
00:02:21.125 --> 00:02:22.708
and experiences joy and sorrow

42
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.791
according to its karma.

43
00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:27.166
Whereas the Paramatma is the witness,

44
00:02:27.166 --> 00:02:30.916
the observer, the permitter, and
the supreme controller –

45
00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:34.000
as was explained in verse 13.23.

46
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:34.958
When someone knows

47
00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:36.791
these different roles

48
00:02:36.791 --> 00:02:39.041
of the jiva and the Paramatma,

49
00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:42.583
their spiritual vision becomes elevated.

50
00:02:42.583 --> 00:02:45.541
They begin to experience the presence

51
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:48.541
and guidance of the Paramatma in every being.

52
00:02:48.541 --> 00:02:50.666
Lord Krishna also says that

53
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:52.458
real liberation comes –

54
00:02:52.458 --> 00:02:54.791
by understanding the distinction
between the body and the soul,

55
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:57.250
and the presence of the Paramatma,

56
00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.458
and by applying this knowledge in life.

57
00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:05.083
The qualities described in
verses 13.8 to 13.12 – such as

58
00:03:05.083 --> 00:03:09.166
humility, vairagya, non-violence, simplicity,

59
00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:10.333
and devotion to God –

60
00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:13.541
show that path of knowledge

61
00:03:13.541 --> 00:03:15.916
which leads to moksha.

62
00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:18.000
Lord Krishna clearly says that

63
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.291
one who walks on this path

64
00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:24.083
gives up attachment to the body and senses,

65
00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:27.291
connects with the Supreme Lord, and ultimately

66
00:03:27.291 --> 00:03:28.750
attains the supreme goal –

67
00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:31.583
that is, the spiritual realm.

68
00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:35.250
Finally, the thirty-fifth verse underlines that

69
00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.041
when we see through

70
00:03:36.041 --> 00:03:39.708
jnana-chakshu – the eye of knowledge –

71
00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:42.333
and understand the process of liberation,

72
00:03:42.333 --> 00:03:44.916
we rise above material bondage

73
00:03:44.916 --> 00:03:47.916
and attain the supreme goal.

74
00:03:52.541 --> 00:03:56.458
Have you ever heard someone say –

75
00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:58.500
‘I already know this…

76
00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.333
I don’t need your advice’?

77
00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:05.375
Perhaps you too have said this sometimes.

78
00:04:05.375 --> 00:04:08.708
I am not criticising –

79
00:04:08.708 --> 00:04:12.083
but the truth is that often

80
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:14.958
this statement comes not from knowledge,

81
00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:17.625
but from ignorance.

82
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:20.791
If you truly want to move forward,

83
00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:24.958
you will have to see not only with material eyes,

84
00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:28.750
but with the jnana-chakshu – the eye of knowledge.

85
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:32.083
This is what teaches you to recognise

86
00:04:32.083 --> 00:04:35.625
reality, beyond surface appearances.

87
00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:37.333
Consider this –

88
00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:40.375
a five-year-old child

89
00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:43.333
and an intelligence officer

90
00:04:43.333 --> 00:04:46.208
both enter a large marketplace

91
00:04:46.208 --> 00:04:49.625
at the same time.

92
00:04:49.625 --> 00:04:52.125
The child sees toys

93
00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:54.375
and colourful things.

94
00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:59.000
The officer sees the security arrangements,
the movement of people,

95
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.333
and possible risks.

96
00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:04.833
The marketplace is the same – but

97
00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:07.125
their vision is different.

98
00:05:07.125 --> 00:05:09.833
In the same way, when you begin

99
00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:12.291
to embrace spiritual knowledge –

100
00:05:12.291 --> 00:05:15.708
when you truly begin to understand
the difference between body and soul,

101
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:19.666
the temporary and the eternal –

102
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:23.708
then your entire experience of life changes.

103
00:05:23.708 --> 00:05:28.791
You are not so easily disturbed by
success or failure.

104
00:05:28.791 --> 00:05:31.833
You see people not only by their actions,

105
00:05:31.833 --> 00:05:33.958
but with compassion –

106
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:37.625
knowing that they too are

107
00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:40.458
struggling souls.

108
00:05:40.458 --> 00:05:44.791
So do not close the door to learning.

109
00:05:44.791 --> 00:05:47.791
Open your heart to such knowledge

110
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:50.791
that expands your consciousness.

111
00:05:50.791 --> 00:05:54.208
This is the path on which, by walking,

112
00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:56.083
you truly grow –

113
00:05:56.083 --> 00:06:01.000
not only spiritually, but in every area of life.

114
00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:08.791
Have you ever sat with your family

115
00:06:08.791 --> 00:06:10.875
and asked everyone –

116
00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:14.958
‘What is the purpose of our journey?’

117
00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:17.625
Most families do not do this!

118
00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:19.666
We get so entangled

119
00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:22.083
in the daily routine –

120
00:06:22.083 --> 00:06:24.875
studies, jobs, bills, holidays –

121
00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:27.625
that we forget to even ask,

122
00:06:27.625 --> 00:06:29.333
‘Where are we going?’

123
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:32.666
In the Gita I have said – one who sees

124
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:34.250
with the jnana-chakshu

125
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:37.833
is the one who understands reality.

126
00:06:37.833 --> 00:06:41.208
This applies not only to spiritual life,

127
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:44.875
but to family life too.

128
00:06:44.875 --> 00:06:48.291
If this deep vision is absent,

129
00:06:48.291 --> 00:06:53.000
then we mistake convenience for purpose,

130
00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:56.666
and take habit to be meaning.

131
00:06:56.666 --> 00:07:00.166
Knowledge gives clarity and teaches

132
00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:04.416
that family is not just the name of
living under one roof –

133
00:07:04.416 --> 00:07:09.541
but the name of growing together,
rising above ignorance,

134
00:07:09.541 --> 00:07:12.708
and supporting one another’s spiritual

135
00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:15.958
and personal journey.

136
00:07:15.958 --> 00:07:19.500
A purposeful family knows

137
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.333
that every decision –

138
00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:23.833
whether how to spend a day off,

139
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:27.666
or how to resolve a disagreement –

140
00:07:27.666 --> 00:07:30.916
can take them closer to peace,

141
00:07:30.916 --> 00:07:35.000
and can also pull them into the depths of confusion!

142
00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.000
But to recognise this,

143
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.375
you must have a trained vision –

144
00:07:41.375 --> 00:07:45.958
a vision that can see, beyond the immediate,

145
00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:48.500
to what truly matters.

146
00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:57.916
Have you ever felt at your workplace

147
00:07:57.916 --> 00:08:02.750
that everything happening around you
– office politics,

148
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:08.000
the equations among colleagues,

149
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.916
or career decisions – feels heavy and
confusing to you?

150
00:08:12.916 --> 00:08:14.250
Most people react

151
00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.333
only by seeing

152
00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:19.458
what appears on the surface –

153
00:08:19.458 --> 00:08:22.041
a sharp comment in a meeting,

154
00:08:22.041 --> 00:08:23.333
someone getting promoted,

155
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:25.416
or a project being postponed –

156
00:08:25.416 --> 00:08:29.083
and immediately jump to conclusions.

157
00:08:29.083 --> 00:08:32.125
But I want to tell you –

158
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:35.250
real clarity does not depend

159
00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:36.458
on what you

160
00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:40.333
see, but on how you see.

161
00:08:40.333 --> 00:08:42.583
This is what I call –

162
00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:47.125
jnana-chakshu – the eye of knowledge.

163
00:08:47.125 --> 00:08:51.000
When you develop knowledge – especially

164
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:54.541
by learning from the right guides

165
00:08:54.541 --> 00:08:56.041
and through deep

166
00:08:56.041 --> 00:09:00.125
reflection – then you begin to see things

167
00:09:00.125 --> 00:09:03.166
as they truly are, and not as

168
00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:07.291
they appear on the surface.

169
00:09:07.291 --> 00:09:11.166
You understand people’s intentions better,

170
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:13.625
you grasp the larger picture,

171
00:09:13.625 --> 00:09:17.500
and you avoid reacting on impulse.

172
00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.291
In fact, true progress

173
00:09:19.291 --> 00:09:22.666
in professional life begins

174
00:09:22.666 --> 00:09:26.166
when you stop giving an emotional reaction

175
00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:29.958
to every small provocation,

176
00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:32.833
and view situations with a trained,

177
00:09:32.833 --> 00:09:35.875
discerning mind.

178
00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:39.375
Just as in the Gita I explain that

179
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:42.875
knowing the distinction between body and soul

180
00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:45.000
leads toward liberation,

181
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.041
in the same way, at the workplace

182
00:09:48.041 --> 00:09:51.083
understanding the difference between
appearance and truth

183
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:54.708
frees you from unnecessary stress –

184
00:09:54.708 --> 00:09:58.416
and helps you make more discerning,

185
00:09:58.416 --> 00:10:02.208
balanced decisions.

186
00:10:02.208 --> 00:10:07.125
Do not only work harder – and see clearly.

187
00:10:07.125 --> 00:10:12.708
Growth begins when knowledge
enters the vision.
